			"hadithnumber": 2959,
			"arabicnumber": 2959,
			"text": "It was narrated from Ibn ‘Umar that the Messenger of Allah (ﷺ) came and performed Tawaf around the House seven times, then he prayed two Rak’ahs. Waki’ said:“Meaning, at the Maqam,* then he went out to Safa.”",
